      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;합성 가죽 소재를 활용한 다용도 솔루션 
    &lt;div id=&#34;합성-가죽-소재를-활용한-다용도-솔루션&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%ed%95%a9%ec%84%b1-%ea%b0%80%ec%a3%bd-%ec%86%8c%ec%9e%ac%eb%a5%bc-%ed%99%9c%ec%9a%a9%ed%95%9c-%eb%8b%a4%ec%9a%a9%eb%8f%84-%ec%86%94%eb%a3%a8%ec%85%98&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
